# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:5
translate portuguese introduction_737a593f:

    # centered "Since ancient times, magic has always silently permeated Earth."
    centered "Desde os tempos antigos, a magia sempre permeou silenciosamente a Terra."

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:9
translate portuguese introduction_794d061d:

    # centered "{color=#f00}It appeared through cracks in the fabric of reality in various locations around the world.{/color}"
    centered "{color=#f00}Ela surgiu através de fendas no tecido da realidade, em diversos locais ao redor do mundo.{/color}"

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:11
translate portuguese introduction_1f0b5ac0:

    # centered "{color=#f00}These cracks served as gateways to allow the creation of different spells.{/color}"
    centered "{color=#f00}Essas fendas serviam como portais que permitiam a criação de diferentes feitiços.{/color}"

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:15
translate portuguese introduction_21f52ffd:

    # centered "However..."
    centered "No entanto..."

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:17
translate portuguese introduction_ee487099:

    # centered "These fissures didn't only transport the magic to our world."
    centered "Essas fissuras não apenas transportavam a magia para o nosso mundo."

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:21
translate portuguese introduction_06f3c7dd:

    # centered "They also served as channels for the manifestation of strong elemental creatures tied to a core element."
    centered "Elas também serviam como canais para a manifestação de poderosas criaturas elementais ligadas a um elemento central."

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:23
translate portuguese introduction_9862a778:

    # centered "Creatures which can blend in and possess different things, like animals in nature and objects and buildings."
    centered "Criaturas capazes de se camuflar e possuir diferentes coisas, como animais da natureza, objetos e até construções."

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:27
translate portuguese introduction_9fd30343:

    # centered "The people of that time discovered something else."
    centered "Além disso, as pessoas daquela época descobriram algo mais."

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:31
translate portuguese introduction_6c605a7d:

    # centered "{color=#0000ff}The elemental creatures need mana to survive. And the most natural way was through the conversion of the human soul.{/color}"
    centered "{color=#0000ff}As criaturas elementais precisam de mana para sobreviver. E a maneira mais natural era através da conversão da alma humana.{/color}"

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:35
translate portuguese introduction_7bd35f04:

    # centered "After years fighting and trying to decipher the secrets of these magical fissures and their beasts, the mages of that era discovered a way to redirect the fissures, channeling them to specific points on Earth"
    centered "Após anos de batalhas e tentativas de decifrar os segredos dessas fissuras mágicas e suas feras, os magos daquela era descobriram uma forma de redirecioná-las, canalizando-as para pontos específicos da Terra."

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:39
translate portuguese introduction_717a1b87:

    # centered "The Rift Temples"
    centered "Os Templos da Ruptura"

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:43
translate portuguese introduction_df468085:

    # centered "An established network of sacred places in central locations around the planet, where these fissures converged. However, the temples could not be protected by incredible magic or anything, it was necessary that the only source of magic that existed in that place was the fissure itself."
    centered "Uma rede estabelecida de lugares sagrados em pontos centrais do planeta, onde essas fissuras convergiam. No entanto, os templos não podiam ser protegidos por magias poderosas ou encantamentos, era necessário que a única fonte de magia existente naquele local fosse a própria fissura."

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:45
translate portuguese introduction_b62b8b29:

    # centered "Consequently, for years, the magical fissures began to fade, gradually losing their intensity and erasing the chances of new magical beasts, but also... removing the mana from our world."
    centered "Consequentemente, ao longo dos anos, as fissuras mágicas começaram a enfraquecer, perdendo gradualmente sua intensidade e eliminando as chances do surgimento de novas criaturas mágicas, mas também... apagando a mana de nosso mundo."

# game/scripts/introduction.rpy:49
translate portuguese introduction_2079d481:

    # centered "..."
    centered "..."
